meta {
  name: Submit Version
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{base_url}}/versions/{{version_id}}/submit
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-User-ID: {{user_id}}
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "comment": "Ready for review"
  }
}

docs {
  Submit a version for review.
  
  State Transition: DRAFT → SUBMITTED
  
  After submission:
  1. Version is ready for approval
  2. Approvers can call /approve (auto-transitions to IN_REVIEW)
  3. OR team lead can call /review to manually transition to IN_REVIEW first
  4. Once all required approvals collected, version moves to APPROVED
  5. Product role can then publish (APPROVED → PUBLISHED)
  
  Workflow for pattern documents:
  DRAFT → SUBMITTED → IN_REVIEW → APPROVED → PUBLISHED
                          ↓
                      REJECTED
}
